# API 测试文件 - 使用 REST Client 扩展

### 变量定义
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiV1 = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### 登录获取 Token
# @name login
POST {{apiV1}}/login/access-token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin@example.com
&password=changethis

###

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 获取当前用户信息
GET {{apiV1}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 获取所有用户 (需要管理员权限)
GET {{apiV1}}/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 创建新用户
POST {{apiV1}}/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testpassword123",
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "is_active": true,
  "is_superuser": false
}

###

### 获取项目列表
GET {{apiV1}}/items/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 创建新项目
POST {{apiV1}}/items/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试项目",
  "description": "这是一个测试项目"
}

###

### 获取单个项目 (替换 {id} 为实际 ID)
GET {{apiV1}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 更新项目
PUT {{apiV1}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新的项目",
  "description": "更新后的描述"
}

###

### 删除项目
DELETE {{apiV1}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
